===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# A [[reindeer]] or a [[caribou]], a general term used to refer to the deer species ''Rangifer tarandus'' and its twelve sub-species.
# A short form of ''[[metsäpeura]]'', the [[Finnish forest reindeer]] (''Rangifer tarandus fennicus'').
# Any medium-sized [[deer]] of unspecified species.

